            <span class="font-body text-[15px] text-ink-secondary">¿Eres independiente, migrante o no tienes patrimonio? <strong class="text-ink">Ni te molestes en aplicar.</strong></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-coral/10 text-coral text-xs">✕</span>
